    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>offset-curve-generate · 3×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 768 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-offset-curve-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-offset-curve-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const outputPositionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputPositions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const outputCountsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputCounts: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 513u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const ROWS_PER_VERTEX: u32 = 17u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const QUAD_SEGMENTS: f32 = 8.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const IS_RING: bool = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const HALF_PI: f32 = 1.5707963267948966;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">fn getLeftNormal(direction: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(-direction.y, direction.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">fn rotateVector(v: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, angle: f32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  let c = cos(angle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  let s = sin(angle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(c * v.x - s * v.y, s * v.x + c * v.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">const NO_LINE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">fn findLine(row: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  var high = LINE_COUNT + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  while (low &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">    if (lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= row) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">      low = middle + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  if (low == 0u || low &gt; LINE_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">    return NO_LINE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"57\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"58\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  _ = &amp;outputPositions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  _ = &amp;outputCounts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  let offsetDistance = parameters[parametersOffset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  let mitreLimit = max(parameters[parametersOffset + 1u], 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  let magnitude = abs(offsetDistance);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  let center = getPosition(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  var points = array&lt;vec2&lt;f32&gt;, 17&gt;();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  var count = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  points[0] = center;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  var hasIncoming = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  var hasOutgoing = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  var incoming = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  var outgoing = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  var incomingLength = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  var outgoingLength = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  let line = findLine(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  if (line != NO_LINE) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">    let lineStart = lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">    let lineEnd = min(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line + 1u], ROW_COUNT);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">    let lineLength = lineEnd - lineStart;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    var previousRow = ROW_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    var nextRow = ROW_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">    if (index &gt; lineStart) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">      previousRow = index - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">    } else if (IS_RING &amp;&amp; lineLength &gt;= 3u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">      previousRow = lineEnd - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">    if (index + 1u &lt; lineEnd) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">      nextRow = index + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">    } else if (IS_RING &amp;&amp; lineLength &gt;= 3u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">      nextRow = lineStart;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">    if (previousRow &lt; ROW_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">      let delta = center - getPosition(previousRow);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">      let deltaLength = length(delta);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">      if (deltaLength &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">        incoming = delta / deltaLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">        incomingLength = deltaLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">        hasIncoming = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">    if (nextRow &lt; ROW_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">      let delta = getPosition(nextRow) - center;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">      let deltaLength = length(delta);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">      if (deltaLength &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">        outgoing = delta / deltaLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">        outgoingLength = deltaLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">        hasOutgoing = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  if (hasIncoming &amp;&amp; !hasOutgoing) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">    points[0] = center + getLeftNormal(incoming) * offsetDistance;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  } else if (!hasIncoming &amp;&amp; hasOutgoing) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    points[0] = center + getLeftNormal(outgoing) * offsetDistance;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">  } else if (hasIncoming &amp;&amp; hasOutgoing) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">    let normalIn = getLeftNormal(incoming);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">    let normalOut = getLeftNormal(outgoing);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">    let a = normalIn * offsetDistance;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">    let b = normalOut * offsetDistance;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">    let turn = incoming.x * outgoing.y - incoming.y * outgoing.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">    let cosTurn = clamp(dot(incoming, outgoing), -1.0, 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">    if (turn * offsetDistance &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; 1.0 + cosTurn &gt; 1e-6) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">      // Inside of the turn: intersection of the two offset segments.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">      points[0] = center + (a + b) / (1.0 + cosTurn);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">    } else if (length(a - b) &lt; magnitude * 1e-3) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">      points[0] = center + a;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">      let turnAngle = acos(cosTurn);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">      let steps = u32(floor(turnAngle * QUAD_SEGMENTS / HALF_PI + 0.5));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">      let direction = select(1.0, -1.0, offsetDistance &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">      points[0] = center + a;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">      if (steps &gt;= 1u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">        for (var arcStep = 1u; arcStep &lt; steps; arcStep++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">          points[arcStep] = center + rotateVector(a, direction * turnAngle * f32(arcStep) / f32(steps));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">        points[steps] = center + b;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">        count = steps + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">        points[1] = center + b;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">        count = 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">  let base = index * ROWS_PER_VERTEX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">  for (var slot = 0u; slot &lt; ROWS_PER_VERTEX; slot++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">    let point = points[min(slot, count - 1u)];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">    let at = outputPositionsOffset + 2u * (base + slot);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">    outputPositions[at] = point.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">    outputPositions[at + 1u] = point.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"167\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"168\">  outputCounts[outputCountsOffset + index] = count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"169\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>lineOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"lineOffsets\">lineOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parameters\">parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputPositions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"offsetCurve\">offsetCurve</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputCounts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"offsetCounts\">offsetCounts</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUOffsetCurve/lines-round-intersection · main · 6de82f00</figcaption></figure></section>",
